# VITE_SUPABASE_URL / VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY: Supabase project connection.
# Find these in Settings -> API on your Supabase project dashboard.
# The anon/publishable key is safe for client-side use — Row Level Security
# enforces access. Everything prefixed VITE_ ends up in the public bundle, so
# never put the service-role/secret key in a VITE_ variable.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL="https://your-project-ref.supabase.co"
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY="your-anon-or-publishable-key"

# Only for scripts/invite-manager.ts, run locally. Never commit a real value.
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=""
